(1) 由 $x^2-4x-5=(x+1)(x-5)$, 可知该式在 $[-1, 5]$ 上非正, 在 $[-2,-1]$ 和 $[5, 6]$ 上非负.

因此
$$f(x)=\begin{cases}x^2-4x-5,&-2\le x\le-1,\\-x^2+4x+5,&-1\le x\le5,\\x^2-4x-5,&5\le x\le6.\end{cases}$$
中间一段为 $y=9-(x-2)^2$, 顶点是 $(2, 9)$, 与 $x$ 轴交于 $(-1, 0)$, $(5, 0)$; 两侧为开口向上的抛物线弧, 端点分别为 $(-2, 7)$, $(6, 7)$. 图象关于直线 $x=2$ 对称, 如下图.

\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.7cm,y=0.45cm]
\draw[step=1,gray!30,very thin] (-2,0) grid (6,10);
\draw[->] (-2.6,0)--(6.8,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-0.6)--(0,10.5) node[above] {$y$};
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\foreach \x in {-2,-1,2,5,6} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12) node[below] {$\x$};}
\foreach \y in {2,4,6,8,9} {\draw (0.12,\y)--(-0.12,\y) node[left] {$\y$};}
\draw[dashed,gray] (2,0)--(2,9);
\draw[thick,domain=-2:-1,samples=40] plot (\x,{\x*\x-4*\x-5});
\draw[thick,domain=-1:5,samples=100] plot (\x,{-\x*\x+4*\x+5});
\draw[thick,domain=5:6,samples=40] plot (\x,{\x*\x-4*\x-5});
\fill (-2,7) circle (2pt) node[above left] {$(-2,7)$};
\fill (-1,0) circle (2pt);
\fill (2,9) circle (2pt) node[above right] {$(2,9)$};
\fill (5,0) circle (2pt);
\fill (6,7) circle (2pt) node[above right] {$(6,7)$};
